How to start this project?

=> Here is the step-by-step procedure to start the project

1. You need to open the Docker Desktop app from you pc.

2. Start Docker Qdrant (vector database) using this command
	=> docker start qdrant
	(Check: http://localhost:6333/dashboard)
	(Check: docker ps)

3. Start Ollama (local LLM) using this command
	=> ollama serve &

4. Start Virtual Environment (Inside the atguru-platform) using this command
	=> source venv/bin/activate

5. Start FastAPI backend (Inside the atguru-platform) using this command
	=> uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
	(Check: http://127.0.0.1:8000/)

6. Start React Frontend (Inside the atguru-platform) using this command
	=> npm start
	(Check: http://localhost:3000/)

*************************************************

How to terminate the project?

=> Here is a step-by-step procedure to terminate the project

1. End the FastAPI backend, in the running bash/terminal, use this command
	=> control + c

2. End the virtual environment in the same bash/terminal(Which has venv at the front), use this command,
	=> deactivate

3. To terminate the Ollama server, use this command
	=> pkill ollama

4. End the React Frontend in the npm running server, use this command
	=> control + c

5. End the Docker Qdrant (vector database) using this command
	=> docker stop qdrant
	(Check: docker ps)

6. Close the Docker Desktop app from you pc manullay.

